label bad_ending:
    play sound "audio/bgs/office_car_bg.mp3"
    scene small office with fade

    show elowyn neutral at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "It had been a week since Elowyn declared the culprit. The town was buzzing, still not fully recovered from the incident."

    show elowyn thinking at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "While she had successfully wrapped up all the cases and was congratulated, Mayor Valentine had stepped down from her position due to backlash."

    show elowyn shocked at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "The new mayor? Elliot, of all people. It was a miracle he was able to handle it, but Elowyn supposed he was the natural second option after Victoria herself."

    show elowyn analyzing at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "Elowyn finally went home, but she couldn’t shake the nagging feeling that something was wrong."

    "Had she really solved the case?"

    show elowyn neutral at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "She would never know."

    "Fin."

return